@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Add registered event consumers that retain events until acknowledged, with restart-safe fetch progress and explicit errors for expired or undelivered cursors. Keep the existing recent-event window for clients that do not register. Reserve outgoing client IDs in the account sidecar and reject cross-request collisions before submission.
